# App Shell

Two machines: **Shell** (menus, AppFlow FSM, Director, SimGate, VContainer) and **Simulation** (ECS). Sim does not know about menus.

## Borrow from gmtk_2026

Eternal Root + additive Game, Root/Game LifetimeScopes (Auto Run off), thin GameDirector, FMOD on Root, ref-counted presentation pause keys.

## Do not borrow from gmtk

